# ── Raw firmware images ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The MTD block dumps are the verbatim flash and contain this device's
# CLEARTEXT secrets (Wi-Fi SSID + passphrase, P2P UID/key, cloud bind token,
# serial, encrypted cloud credential). Never commit them.
FirmwareDump/*.bin
FirmwareDump/*.img
FirmwareDump/*.bin.gz
# Keep FirmwareDump/README.md and mtd.txt (generic partition map, no secrets).

# Any stray re-dumps elsewhere
*.mtdblock
mtdblock*.bin

# ── OS / editor cruft ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
